      "guid": "com.shibdib.sniperbros",
      "name": "Sniper Bros",
      "slug": "sniper-bros",
      "teaser": "Sniper Scavs are bros to all bots.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/VjP0I99H1gO0KBluyMC8d8g4IqLf2afZH3WgAMkz.jpg",
      "downloads": 3247,
      "favourites_count": 12,
      "description": "<p>This mod is simple. It makes Marksman/Sniper scavs non-hostile to other AI bots. Why? Because the AI bots would annoyingly get stuck staring at ceilings trying to find them before.</p>\n<p>Why not just not spawn in marksman you ask? Because how would you do those annoying tasks that require kills for them.</p>\n<p>Install:</p>\n<p>Extract the mod into the main folder of your game install.</p>\n<p>FIKA/Headless:</p>\n<p>This mod only needs to be on the host. So if you use a headless it only needs to be there.</p>\n<p>Compatibility:</p>\n<p>Should work with everything.</p>\n<p>How’s it work?</p>\n<p>On bot spawn in it’ll add bots to the allies list of marksman and vice versa.</p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2663/sniper-bros",
